<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8831" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθρᾰκ-ιά</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾶς</span>, 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθρᾰκ-ιή</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆς</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>burning charcoal, hot embers,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθρακιὴν στορέσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.213
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθεῖναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
					61
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθρακιᾶς ἄπο</span> a broil
			hot from <i>the embers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				358
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.105
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Apollonid.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀνθρακιᾶς ὀπτῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					143
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σου τῆς ἀνθρακιᾶς
			ἀπολαύει</span> warms himself at your <i>fire,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				780
			</span></i>: metaph. of lovers, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιθέναι τινὰ
				ὑπὸ ἀνθρακιῆ</span> or 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνθρακιήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.17
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				166
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Asclep.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κύπριδος ἀ.</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				5.210
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Posidipp.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>black sooty ashes,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				11.66
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>).</div>
